 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
 ## [Unreleased]
+
+- **Navigate runtime controller class strings.** Laravel `Controller@method` class parts support definition, hover and references using group namespaces independently of PHP imports. These runtime references do not count as constructor calls or unknown-class diagnostics. Class and namespace edits involving them refuse partial rewrites until a dedicated quoting-aware plan exists. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Keep method suggestions out of controller class names.** Completion before `@` in a Laravel string action no longer offers methods from an enclosing controller group. Bare action and method-suffix completion remain available. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
